step :04(password)
_________

	go to github select all repositories than create repository 
	then select username and name it exact your github account name
	 then set it to public and click create then click on github pic
	and go to setting>developer setting>personal access token (classic) 
	lastly select one with (repo). if you lastly select without repo it will
	be rejected.
	
	Go to repository and select the three dot menu . go to the setting of it 
	.the select public.choose build and deployment  source, deploy from a branch
	than main and root .

	THEN your username.github.io search it .
	It is now pubpished online tempprarily.
